"Monthly payment amount": "Cantidad del pago mensual",
"The full Pay someone flow in Figma, with its screens and decision points": "El flujo completo de Pay someone en Figma, con sus pantallas y decisiones",
"One job was still unmet: changing what you pay each month ↓": "Faltaba resolver algo: cambiar lo que pagas cada mes ↓",
"Customers wanted to say how much they could pay, without editing twelve purchases. So one amount became the starting point. Move the slider.": "La gente quería decir cuánto podía pagar, sin editar doce compras. Así que una sola cantidad se convirtió en el punto de partida. Mueve el control.",
